{"s":[[null,1,[["p",[["l","收集包","Bundles"]," are donations to the ",["l","祝尼魔","Junimos"]," given via golden scrolls inside the ",["l","社区中心","Community Center"],". When a bundle is complete, the Junimos offer the player a reward. When all bundles for a particular room in the Community Center are complete, the Junimos grant a special reward that sometimes benefits the entire community."]],["p",["Bundle rewards are given immediately, but rewards for completing all bundles in a room are given at the end of the day via a cutscene depicting the Junimos fulfilling the reward. If two rooms are completed on the same day, only one of the cutscenes is shown. Note that if the player does not collect individual bundle rewards before completing the room, the rewards can be found in a small brown bag to the left of the Junimo Hut after the golden scroll disappears. This bag persists after the ",["l","社区中心","Community Center"]," completion ceremony, until all items are retrieved from it."]],["p",["A few bundles display more items than there are slots to fill (e.g., Artisan Bundle: 12 items, 6 slots to fill). In this case, the player can choose which of the shown items they want to use to fill the bundle. They do not have to use all shown items, only enough to fill the slots."]],["p",["Completing all bundles restores the Community Center to its condition when it was brand new and unlocks the ",["l","成就","\"Local Legend\""]," Steam achievement. That night, the game also unlocks a cut scene that shows the grand re-opening of the Community Center. This scene is triggered by entering ",["l","鹈鹕镇","Pelican Town"]," Square any time thereafter on a sunny day, unless a festival is to be held in the town that day. Mayor Lewis announces that the player has won the Stardew Hero award and gives the player a trophy."]],["p",["If the player opts to purchase a ",["l","Joja超市","JojaMart"]," Membership, the Community Center is turned into a ",["l","Joja仓库","Joja Warehouse"]," instead. After this happens, the bundles will be completed by the Joja Corporation for a fee given to ",["l","莫里斯","Morris"],", the local JojaMart manager, through the ",["l","Joja社区发展申请书","Joja Community Development Form"],"."]],["g",[["Golden_Scroll.png",64,["Golden Scroll"]]]],["p",["There is a total of 6 rooms and 30 bundles to complete in the Community Center. In the Joja Warehouse, there are 5 rewards to purchase (the \"Friendship\" reward is not available)."]],["p",["Bundle Progress can be checked at any time by clicking on the Golden Scroll icon at the top right of the Player Menu (above the Garbage Can and \"organize\" icons). Selecting or hovering the mouse pointer over an inventory item that is needed for a bundle makes the Golden Scroll icon pulsate."]],["p",["Bundles that do not specify quality will accept items of any quality. For bundles that need multiple items, multiple stacks of different qualities are acceptable as long as they add up to the required amount. For bundles that do specify a quality, a better quality is also acceptable."]]]],["Traveling Cart Availability",2,[["p",["All items required for bundles have a small chance of appearing in the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"],", except for the items listed below. These items will never be sold at the Traveling Cart:"]],["t",[[{"b":[["l",0,[[1,[["i","(O)80","Quartz"]]],[1,[["i","(O)812","Roe"],"*"]],[1,[["i","(O)64","Ruby"],"*"]],[1,[["i","(O)814","Squid Ink"],"*"]],[1,[["i","(O)417","Sweet Gem Berry"],"*"]],[1,[["i","(O)68","Topaz"],"*"]],[1,[["i","(O)795","Void Salmon"]]],[1,[["i","(O)246","Wheat Flour"],"*"]],[1,[["i","(O)157","White Algae"],"*"]]]]]}]]],["p",["*Used only in ",["l","重新混合的收集包","Remixed Bundles"]]]]],["Standard Bundles",2,[]],["Crafts Room",3,[["g",[["Community_Center_Crafts_Room.png",320,["Crafts Room Before Completion"]]]],["g",[["Finished_Crafts_Room.webp",320,["Crafts Room After Completion"]]]],["p",["The Crafts Room contains the first group of bundles available. Completing all Crafts Room bundles repairs the bridge east of ",["l","矿井","The Mines"],", unlocking the ",["l","采石场","Quarry"],"."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":[["f","Bundle_Complete_Balloon.png",28]]},{"h":1,"v":["Crafts\nRoom\nReward"]},[["l","采石场","Bridge Repair"]]]]],["t",[[{"c":4,"h":1,"v":[["f","Bundle_Green.png",32]," Spring Foraging Bundle"]}],[{"r":4,"v":[["f","Spring_Foraging_Bundle.png",136]]},{"r":4,"v":[["f","Bundle_Slot.png",36],["f","Bundle_Slot.png",36],["f","Bundle_Slot.png",36],["f","Bundle_Slot.png",36]]},[["i","(O)16","Wild Horseradish"]],[["l","春季","Spring"]," ",["l","采集","Foraging"]]],[[["i","(O)18","Daffodil"]],[["l","春季","Spring"]," ",["l","采集","Foraging"],", buy from ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"]," at ",["l","花舞节","Flower Dance"]]],[[["i","(O)20","Leek"]],[["l","春季","Spring"]," ",["l","采集","Foraging"]]],[[["i","(O)22","Dandelion"]],[["l","春季","Spring"]," ",["l","采集","Foraging"],", buy from ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"]," at ",["l","花舞节","Flower Dance"]]],[{"c":2,"v":[["f","Bundle_Reward.png",18]," Reward:"]},{"c":2,"v":[["i","(O)495","Spring Seeds ×30"]]}]]],["t",[[{"c":4,"h":1,"v":[["f","Bundle_Yellow.png",32]," Summer Foraging Bundle"]}],[{"r":3,"v":[["f","Summer_Foraging_Bundle.png",136]]},{"r":3,"v":[["f","Bundle_Slot.png",36],["f","Bundle_Slot.png",36],["f","Bundle_Slot.png",36]]},[["i","(O)398","Grape"]],[["l","夏季","Summer"]," ",["l","采集","Foraging"],", ",["l","秋季","Fall"]," ",["l","耕种","Farming"]]],[[["i","(O)396","Spice Berry"]],[["l","夏季","Summer"]," ",["l","采集","Foraging"],", ",["l","山洞","The Farm Cave"]," (fruit bat option)"]],[[["i","(O)402","Sweet Pea"]],[["l","夏季","Summer"]," ",["l","采集","Foraging"]]],[{"c":2,"v":[["f","Bundle_Reward.png",18]," Reward:"]},{"c":3,"v":[["i","(O)496","Summer Seeds ×30"]]}]]],["t",[[{"c":4,"h":1,"v":[["f","Bundle_Orange.png",32]," Fall Foraging Bundle"]}],[{"r":4,"v":[["f","Fall_Foraging_Bundle.png",136]]},{"r":4,"v":[["f","Bundle_Slot.png",36],["f","Bundle_Slot.png",36],["f","Bundle_Slot.png",36],["f","Bundle_Slot.png",36]]},[["i","(O)404","Common Mu